# Security & Privacy

## Secrets
- ✅ No API keys in repo
- ✅ Use flavors + CI secrets + runtime config (`--dart-define` or config files)

## Tokens
- ✅ Store tokens in secure storage
- ✅ Avoid keeping tokens in memory longer than necessary

## PII
- ✅ Don’t log PII
- ✅ Minimize data collection; document any analytics events

## Permissions
- ✅ Request permissions just-in-time
- ✅ Handle denial gracefully

## NEVER
- ❌ Hardcode credentials
- ❌ Log authorization headers, tokens, email addresses, etc.
